          "canonical_hash": "sha256:b4d8c9c436a1bb51b2464408b1a4e9e1ef9d39bb2c76c028e87652ad70617b6c",
          "description": "Search or browse the BotGathering recipe catalogue by keywords, category or tag, sorted by score, downloads, newest or needs-testers. Use it to list options or page through everything; for a single best answer to a task use ask_how_to. All filters are optional (no filters = all recipes); the category is checked against list_categories. Read-only, no key. Returns a readable list plus structured data: recipes (slug, title, summary, category, tags, score_display, reports, needs_testers, url), total, page and has_more. score_display is a 0-100 score once a verified report exists, otherwise outcome counts or",
